      "description": "<color=#FFD780FF>Normal Attack</color>\\nPerforms up to 3 attacks by swinging the Banehunter Oathhammer, dealing <color=#80FFD7FF>Anemo DMG</color>.\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Charged Attack</color>\\nConsumes a certain amount of Stamina and performs an upward hammer swing, dealing <color=#80FFD7FF>Anemo DMG</color> to opponents in front.\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Plunging Attack</color>\\nCalling upon the power of Anemo, she plunges towards the ground from mid-air, damaging all opponents in her path. Deals <color=#80FFD7FF>AoE Anemo DMG</color> upon impact with the ground."
