      "description": "Prune gently swings the Witchlure Bell, dealing <color=#80FFD7FF>Anemo DMG</color> to nearby opponents. After this, the Bell will enter the Hunter-Seeker mode.\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Witchlure Bell: Hunter-Seeker</color>\\nIn this mode, the Witchlure Bell will follow the current active character, attacking surrounding opponents at intervals and dealing <color=#80FFD7FF>AoE Anemo DMG</color>. This DMG is considered Elemental Burst DMG.\n\\n\\n<i>\"Descartes might be an imaginary friend, but that doesn't mean he's 'fake.' He's 'my' imaginary friend, and that's exactly how he exists in truth.\"</i>"
    },
